  "notes": [
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "amani ithano × ithatũ",
      "rationale": "Ũtuaria wa kĩgera kĩa kiyori: mũkũra, mũhia, na kũigũrũ kwa amani."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "ויברך \/ ברכיו",
      "rationale": "Mũrĩ ũmwe ברך — 'kũhoya' na 'gũikara magũrũ-inĩ'; mũhiano ũrakoragwo harĩ hooya hĩndĩ aciara magũrũ, ũrĩa wonagwo na Gĩkũyũ tu nĩgeethia mĩhari ĩrĩ ĩkoragwo iciarĩtwo."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "כיור",
      "rationale": "Kiugo gĩaĩtwo 'kiindũ kĩa gũtherema' (nĩ kĩndũ gĩa ũgoro); tauta iria irĩ taguo 'scaffold' kana 'platform' — windi-wa-mabara nĩguo nĩ wega mũno gũkũ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "השמימה",
      "rationale": "Ndemwa ĩrĩa ĩrĩ dual — 'igũrũ-rĩa-ĩrĩ'; Gĩkũyũ nĩ 'ĩgũrũ' o ĩmwe, dual nĩ yaarũokire."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Nĩguo Ceromo anjũĩrire kiyori wa necocheti, na nĩĩĩgĩte thĩinĩ wa azara: amani ithano mũkũra wakĩo, na amani ithano mũhia wakĩo, na amani ithatũ kũigũrũ kwakĩo; nĩagĩikara igũrũ yake, akĩhoya thĩ handũ ha magũrũ make, mbere ya andũ a kĩama kĩa Yiceraeri othingo, na akĩtambũra makono make kũgera ĩgũrũ.",
